{"ticker":"AMGN","updated":"2026-11-27T22:36:38Z","profile":{"longName":"Amgen Inc.","shortName":"Amgen Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"United States","website":"https://www.amgen.com","fullTimeEmployees":31500,"marketCap":256435306496,"trailingPE":27.482899,"forwardPE":18.868366,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.5916586,"pegRatio":2.13,"targetMeanPrice":440.779,"targetHighPrice":550.0,"targetLowPrice":230.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":30,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.085,"earningsGrowth":0.194,"grossMargins":0.72464997,"operatingMargins":0.34120998,"profitMargins":0.24139999,"totalRevenue":38903001088,"beta":0.417,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":483.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":312.39,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.15},"summary":"Amgen Inc. discovers, develops, manufactures, and delivers human therapeutics worldwide. The company's principal products include Enbrel for the treatment of rheumatoid arthritis, plaque psoriasis, and psoriatic arthritis; Otezla for the treatment of adult patients with plaque psoriasis, psoriatic arthritis, and oral ulcers associated with Behçet's disease; Prolia to treat postmenopausal women with osteoporosis; XGEVA for skeletal-related events prevention; Repatha, which reduces the risks of myocardial infarction, stroke, and coronary revascularization; Nplate for the treatment of patients with immune thrombocytopenia; KYPROLIS to treat patients with relapsed or refractory multiple myeloma; Aranesp to treat a lower-than-normal number of red blood cells and anemia; EVENITY for the treatment of osteoporosis in postmenopausal for women; Vectibix to treat patients with wild-type RAS metastatic colorectal cancer; BLINCYTO for the treatment of patients with acute lymphoblastic leukemia; TEPEZZA to treat thyroid eye disease; and KRYSTEXXA for the treatment of chronic refractory gout. It also markets other products, including PROLIA, REPATHA, OTEZLA, ENBREL, EVENITY, XGEVA, TEPEZZA, BLINCYTO, NPLATE, TEZSPIRE, KYPROLIS, ARANESP, KRYSTEXXA AND VECTIBIX, MVASI, PAVBLU, UPLIZNA, IMDELLTRA/IMDYLLTRA, AMJEVITA/AMGEVITA, TAVNEOS, NEULASTA, LUMAKRAS/LUMYKRAS, RAVICTI, PARSABIV, AIMOVIG, WEZL","summary_zh":"安進公司 (Amgen Inc.) 在全球範圍內發現、開發、製造和提供人類治療藥物。該公司的主要產品包括用於治療類風濕性關節炎、斑塊狀銀屑病和銀屑病關節炎的Enbrel；免疫性血小板減少症患者用於治療免疫性血小板減少症患者；KYPROLIS 用於治療復發或難治性多發性骨髓瘤患者； Aranesp 用於治療紅血球數量低於正常水平和貧血；EVENITY 用於治療女性停經後骨質疏鬆症； Vectibix 用於治療紅血球數量低於正常水平和貧血；EVENITY 用於治療女性停經後骨質疏鬆症；Vectibix 用於治療紅血球數量低於正常的野生型 RAS 轉移性結直腸癌患者；用於治療慢性難治性痛風。它還銷售其他產品，包括 PROLIA、REPATHA、OTEZLA、ENBREL、EVENITY、XGEVA、TEPEZZA、BLINCYTO、NPLATE、TEZSPIRE、KYPROLIS、ARANESP、KRYSTEXXA 和 VECTIBIX、MVASI、PAVBLU、LIZAMNA、IMELL、VUUU​​TDTATAST AUUUIMBB 等成為說成為UBBD. NEULASTA、LUMAKRAS/LUMYKRAS、RAVICTI、PARSABIV、AIMOVIG、WEZL","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":273.1,"h":274.52,"l":270.67,"c":273.97,"v":1769100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":274.14,"h":284.82,"l":274.02,"c":282.2,"v":3508700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":284.45,"h":301.66,"l":283.0,"c":298.5,"v":4835400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":298.31,"h":300.5,"l":295.46,"c":297.4,"v":2123200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":297.72,"h":301.54,"l":295.63,"c":297.89,"v":2518500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":297.62,"h":297.62,"l":293.03,"c":294.12,"v":1957300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":293.27,"h":295.85,"l":290.21,"c":295.54,"v":1504300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":295.79,"h":297.63,"l":292.29,"c":294.62,"v":2940600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":294.13,"h":296.63,"l":293.7,"c":295.43,"v":1369000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":296.16,"h":297.09,"l":289.58,"c":290.13,"v":2660500},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":291.75,"h":296.13,"l":289.44,"c":292.4,"v":1838400},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":291.75,"h":296.87,"l":290.97,"c":293.85,"v":1975900},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":292.82,"h":298.21,"l":292.43,"c":297.32,"v":2502100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":298.07,"h":302.27,"l":294.44,"c":295.81,"v":1715000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":295.24,"h":299.37,"l":293.14,"c":298.81,"v":1959400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":299.48,"h":303.66,"l":